### List integration metadata
GET http://localhost:3001/api/integrations
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: studio-user
x-permissions: FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH

### Test generic connector
POST http://localhost:3001/api/connectors/test
content-type: application/json
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: studio-user
x-permissions: FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH

{
  "connectorCode": "GENERIC_WEBHOOK",
  "payload": {
    "document": {
      "id": "SIMULATED_DOCUMENT"
    }
  }
}

### Test integration mapping and connector execution
POST http://localhost:3001/api/integrations/test
content-type: application/json
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: studio-user
x-permissions: FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH

{
  "integrationCode": "SEND_NOTIFICATION_INTEGRATION",
  "payload": {
    "document": {
      "id": "SIMULATED_DOCUMENT"
    },
    "event": {
      "code": "WORK_ORDER_STARTED_EVENT"
    },
    "runtimeState": {
      "workflowState": "IN_PROGRESS"
    }
  }
}

### Runtime proof
# Triggering START through the runtime action pipeline should produce trace steps:
# EVENT SUCCESS
# INTEGRATION SUCCESS
# CONNECTOR EXECUTED in the integration result payload.
